        "y0": 0.7916666666666666,
        "x1": 0.8945621665007149,
        "y1": 0.8055555555555556
      },
      "text": "in each slip system. Our studies included these vari-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
