    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4989545734879238,
        "y0": 0.8623737373737373,
        "x1": 0.9005762237349367,
        "y1": 0.8762626262626263
      },
      "text": "Having developed a plasticity model for single beryl-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07819297266941444,
        "y0": 0.8800505050505051,
        "x1": 0.4696994918623781,
        "y1": 0.8939393939393939
      },
      "text": "that run ahead of the shock. From these waves, we",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49972399543313417,
        "y0": 0.8800505050505051,
        "x1": 0.9014396916807087,
        "y1": 0.8939393939393939
      },
      "text": "lium crystals, we can predict the response of a given",
